2024/11/24 v0.1
- Initial Github upload

2024/12/23 v0.2
Features:
- create selfsigned-certificate if no certificate is available
- add settings page with certificate defaults
- add dark-/lightmode
- search/filter for certificates-table

2026/01/31 v0.3 - Security Hardening Release
Security Improvements:
- SECURITY: Removed hardcoded password hash from repository
- SECURITY: Upgraded RSA key size from 2048 to 4096 bits for all certificates
- SECURITY: Fixed path traversal vulnerability in certificate file operations
- SECURITY: Hardened directory permissions (0777 -> 0700/0750)
- SECURITY: Hardened file permissions for private keys (0600)
- SECURITY: Added proper session error handling
- SECURITY: Added CSRF protection for all forms
- SECURITY: Added configurable debug logging (disabled by default)
- SECURITY: Added sanitization for all user input used in file paths
- SECURITY: Added proper error handling for file deletion operations
- FIX: Added missing email field to settings API response
- FIX: Fixed malformed HTML attribute in settings template

2026/10/24 v0.4 - CSR Signing & Pocket ID / OIDC Authentication
Features:
- FEAT: External CSR (Certificate Signing Request) signing support using Go standard library crypto/x509
- FEAT: Support for uploading .csr/.pem files or pasting raw CSR PEM text directly
- FEAT: Automatic extraction of CommonName, Subject attributes, and SANs (DNS, IP, Email, URI) from CSRs
- FEAT: Distinct CSR badge in certificate dashboard with protected key handling (private keys remain on source device)
- FEAT: Pocket ID and generic OpenID Connect (OIDC) SSO authentication with Passkey support
- FEAT: Built-in custom trust pool automatically trusting local Root CA for internal OIDC IdP endpoints
- FEAT: Cryptographically random CSRF state validation with SameSite=Lax cookie handling for OIDC flows
- FEAT: Docker environment variable overrides (OIDC_ENABLED, OIDC_ISSUER_URL, OIDC_CLIENT_ID, OIDC_CLIENT_SECRET, OIDC_REDIRECT_URL)
- FEAT: Emergency local admin fallback on the sign-in screen to prevent lockouts during IdP renewal
- FEAT: Interactive OIDC settings card with real-time toggle switch and client secret mask toggle
- UI: Modern glassmorphic styling updates, toggle switches, and responsive layout improvements
- UI: Restored dedicated showcase card for the Certificate Manager service certificate in certificate dashboard
- SECURITY: Unprivileged Docker container execution (appuser, UID 10001) with automatic legacy permission migration

